  partName: Valve Cover Gasket
  description: The Valve Cover Gasket is a small, thin-flat gasket positioned at
    the top-center-center of the engine, sealing the valve cover to the cylinder
    head. Its primary function is to prevent oil leaks and maintain a clean engine
    environment, ensuring proper valve operation and engine performance. Notably,
    the gasket's material, Frame, is designed to provide a durable, long-lasting
    seal, even in the presence of high temperatures and pressures.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
